        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img alt="" loading="lazy" id="w-node-_2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63771-83c22e73" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/69077b5c6c3562357534cd81_gartner%20blog%202%20cover.png" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/69077b5c6c3562357534cd81_gartner%20blog%202%20cover-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/69077b5c6c3562357534cd81_gartner%20blog%202%20cover-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/69077b5c6c3562357534cd81_gartner%20blog%202%20cover-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/69077b5c6c3562357534cd81_gartner%20blog%202%20cover.png 1200w" class="post-image"><div class="post-content-div"><div class="div-block-992"><div class="div-block-1010"><div fs-list-field="category" class="blog-category">AI</div><div class="highlight-tag pop w-condition-invisible">Popular</div><div class="highlight-tag w-condition-invisible">Highlights</div><div class="hide w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div fs-list-field="Topic">AI SOC</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div fs-list-field="Topic">CDR</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div fs-list-field="Topic">CloudTwin</div></div></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775_instance-3" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2269077be2f138e505084b7789%22%7D%5D" href="/post/faster-better-using-data-to-make-your-ai-soc-shine" class="b-title w-inline-block"><h2 fs-list-field="title" class="heading-29 blog">Faster &amp; Better: Using Data to Make Your AI SOC Shine</h2><div class="blog-par limit-char">AI tools are only as effective as the