        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img alt="" loading="lazy" id="w-node-_2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63771-83c22e73" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68f8fbabe2fd1f9a3af7dc3a_gap2%20cover.png" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68f8fbabe2fd1f9a3af7dc3a_gap2%20cover-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68f8fbabe2fd1f9a3af7dc3a_gap2%20cover-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68f8fbabe2fd1f9a3af7dc3a_gap2%20cover-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/68f8fbabe2fd1f9a3af7dc3a_gap2%20cover.png 1200w" class="post-image"><div class="post-content-div"><div class="div-block-992"><div class="div-block-1010"><div fs-list-field="category" class="blog-category">Cloud Detection &amp; Response </div><div class="highlight-tag pop">Popular</div><div class="highlight-tag w-condition-invisible">Highlights</div><div class="hide w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div fs-list-field="Topic">CDR</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div fs-list-field="Topic">CloudTwin</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div fs-list-field="Topic">AI SOC</div></div></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775_instance-4" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2268e8d4ca11122af5b18fd58f%22%7D%5D" href="/post/closing-the-gap-how-automated-ai-triage-transforms-cloud-saas-secops" class="b-title w-inline-block"><h2 fs-list-field="title" class="heading-29 blog">Closing the Gap: How Automated AI Triage Transforms Cloud &amp; SaaS Threat Detection</h2><div class="blog-par limit-char">Stream.Security just launched a new AI Triage feature to assist analysts in addressing the growing volume of alerts in the cloud and SaaS. The AI Triage agent brings human-like intelligence and decision making to SOC analysts. With Stream’s real-time CloudTwin model, the triage digests updated risk-based data that factors in asset criticality, exposure, and blast radius to prioritize alerts that truly matter. </div></a></div><div class="divider-full space small"></div><div class="div-block-773"><div class="writer-small dark"><img height="70" width="70" alt="Asaf Haski" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6877c24e9982eb4c671d0e00_Assaf.webp" sizes="70px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6877c24e9982eb4c671d0e00_Assaf-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6877c24e9982eb4c671d0e00_Assaf.webp 800w" class="writer-image-small"><div><div fs-list-field="author" class="writer---blog-page-home">Asaf Haski</div></div></div><div class="div-block-790 xs"><div class="div-block-953"><div class="writer---blog-page-home date">Oct 22, 2025</div></div><div class="code-embed-3 w-embed"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
